---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";

import teamPic from "../assets/roboticslogo-iconcolored.png";
import botPic from "../assets/roboticslogo-iconcolored.png";
---

<Page>
    <div class="segment reverse">
        <img class="full" src={teamPic.src} alt="Team 33517 Robot Photo">
        <div class="segment-content">
            
            <h2>About <span class="keyword">Team 33517</span></h2>
            <p>
                <b>New Horizons</b> is the newest member of the Nighthawks Robotics flock. Our dedicated members are currently composed of Grade 10 and 11 students, ready to embrace the legacy of Nighthawks Robotics during the Decode season.
            </p>
            <p>
                As a learning team, New Horizons focuses on gaining hands-on experience with robot design, programming, and teamwork. The team is preparing to actively contribute to the Nighthawks program and build a strong foundation for future competitions.
            </p>

            <h2>Goals & Future Plans</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>Provide a supportive learning environment for new members</li>
                <li>Develop skills in programming, mechanical design, and team strategy</li>
                <li>Prepare for full participation in the 2025-26 Decode season</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</Page>
